Why AGPL-3.0 for NIS2 Compass
==============================

NIS2 Compass is a governance platform: it tracks regulatory compliance
against NIS2 Article 21(2) measures and produces evidence artefacts
that enter the CITADEL WORM audit chain. AGPL-3.0 ensures that any
modified version operated as a network service must publish its source
to its users — preventing a closed-source fork of compliance tooling
from diverging silently from the reference implementation regulators
and auditors rely on. Tool platforms in this repository (APIGuard,
ThreatFlow, SDKs) remain Apache-2.0; the copyleft obligation is scoped
to governance-critical platforms by design. The licence split is
declared in the root LICENSE file.
